LE / AESTHETIC LAYER\n• Genre: Swiss Brutalist & Haute-Couture Campaign art direction.\n• Typography System: Hybrid Storytelling Typography: Massive stacked luxury editorial serif (Didot/Ogg/GT Super) with tight leading for punchline thesis statements, paired with clean, crisp, modern white grotesque sans-serif (Inter/Archivo) for narrative storytelling paragraphs.\n• Color Palette: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, Crisp White (#FFFFFF) text, Muted Platinum (#E2E2E8) accents, Studio Slate (#141418), and colors: Crisp white contrast overlay, Natural depth plane separation\n• Stickers & Decals: Zero artificial stickers or badges. Clean unadorned cinematic photography with pure white typography floating in atmospheric negative space.\n• Metadata & Framing: Integrate \"// project\\ciel · AUTEUR DIRECTING\", \"[CIEL · 2026]\", and header/nav style: Clean negative space framing with pure white (#FFFFFF) typography placed directly over the cinematic photograph.\n\n=== [EDITORIAL CINEMATIC PHOTO-NARRATIVE DIRECTIVE] ===\n• Background: Full-bleed authentic 4:5 cinematic photography (evocative, atmospheric, rich materials, 35mm film grain, natural light).\n• Typography: Pure crisp white (#FFFFFF) text placed directly over the photograph. Massive stacked luxury editorial serif (Didot/Ogg/Playfair) with tight line height for punchlines, and clean modern white sans-serif for story paragraphs.\n• Composition: Clean negative space placement, zero artificial stickers, zero clip art, high-status auteur editorial magazine art direction.\n\n=== [SLIDE 4 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 4 of 8 (STEP2)\nCard Counter Tag: \"04 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"STEP 02: THE PROMPT\"\nMain Headline: \"step 2: the exact copy-paste prompt formula.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"copy-paste, prompt formula\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Paste this exact prompt structure into Nano Banana:\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"1. \"Use this image as reference f